    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to find success in this divine mission? You and Mo, your moai pal , must reach the top of the Moai World before seven days pass to prevent its destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail, the world will reset, and you\u2019ll have to start from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So run, jump, and reach higher and higher places alongside Mo\u2014but be careful! A single wrong move could send you tumbling into the darkest depths of despair.</p>",
